# Claude Code - local agent state stays out of the repo; repo-scoped agent
# tooling is committed by explicit allowlist only. Add one `!` line per file
# that should ship; everything else under .claude/ stays ignored, including
# worktrees/, settings.local.json, scheduled_tasks.lock and stacks/ run state.
#
# `.claude/*` rather than `.claude/`: a directory ignore stops git descending,
# so a `!` line on a leaf inside it can never take effect. Every parent level
# has to be un-ignored before its children can be, hence the repeated
# ignore-parent / un-ignore-dir / ignore-children / un-ignore-leaf ladder.
CLAUDE.md
.claude/*
!.claude/commands/
.claude/commands/*
!.claude/commands/implement-issues.md
!.claude/commands/implement-issues/
.claude/commands/implement-issues/*
!.claude/commands/implement-issues/stack-merge.sh

# Node
node_modules/

# Python (consolidated from odoo_sdk)
**/__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
.venv/
libraries/odoo_sdk/build/
libraries/odoo_sdk/docs/build/
libraries/odoo_sdk/docs/source/api/
.hypothesis/
.cosmic-ray/
reports/
*.egg-info/
.coverage
.complexipy_cache/

# Secrets
.odoo_sdk.ini
